<li>Change 34, commits on 6 November: <code>68efa8f06</code>, &ldquo;coordinator, fortress-repo: the curator&rsquo;s standing order on branches&rdquo;, 12:32 UTC, the first wording; <code>730daf06a</code>, &ldquo;coordinator, fortress-repo: the cold read&rsquo;s fixes on the branch order&rdquo;, 12:40 UTC, the fixes after the cold read. Base: the parent of <code>68efa8f06</code>. The curator&rsquo;s order: his words in chat at 12:3x UTC on 6 November, &ldquo;We already know that branches cannot be deleted from your cloud container. And I will get to them when I get to them.&rdquo;</li>
<li>Provenance, not an item: <code>references/sources.md</code> gained the section &ldquo;The curator&rsquo;s standing order on branches, 2026-11-06&rdquo;, with a line for the cold read.</li>
